  "goodToKnow": "Stopfen means to stuff or cram (Kleider in den Koffer stopfen, sich den Mund voll stopfen), to darn (Socken stopfen) and to plug a gap: ein Haushaltsloch stopfen (to plug a budget hole). Some foods are said to stopfen (cause constipation), like chocolate. Jemandem das Maul stopfen means to shut someone up. Regular: stopfte, gestopft. Not related to English stop."
